Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: of integrity promotion programs

1268
01:30:41,740 --> 01:30:43,580
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: to generate a critical

1269
01:30:43,580 --> 01:30:45,760
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: mass of anti-corruption advocates

1270
01:30:45,760 --> 01:30:47,600
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: in the campaign against

1271
